trong></span> is fully depleted, hold <img loading="lazy" src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/UiIconPcBtn/T_IconPcBtn_MouseLeft_UI.webp" alt="æ”»å‡»" class="mx-0.5 inline h-5 w-5 align-[-0.1em]"></p> </div><div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-200"> <p>Â· Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven: Press <img loading="lazy" src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/UiIconPcBtn/T_IconPcBtn_KeyR_UI.webp" alt="å¤§æ‹›" class="mx-0.5 inline h-5 w-5 align-[-0.1em]"></p> </div></div> </article></div> </section> <section data-ui="character-skill-section" data-variant="surface" class="ui-section ui-section--surface ui-section--normal ui-section--separated"><header class="ui-section-header"><h2 class="ui-section-title font-display text-xl font-bold">Combat Skills</h2> <div class="ui-section-header__actions"><div class="ui-character-skill-section__actions"><label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300"><span>Simple Description</span> <input type="checkbox" class="h-4 w-4 text-accent focus:ring-accent"></label></div></div></header> <div class="mt-4 grid gap-5 xl:grid-cols-2"><article data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="default" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--default  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Atlas/SkillIcon/SkillIconNor/SP_IconNorMagic.webp" alt="Manifold Bloom" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Manifold Bloom</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Normal Attack</span> </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line"><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Basic Attack - Answering Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span>, perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span>, consume STA to deal <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>After casting this skill, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span> and in mid-air, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> to perform a Plunging Attack at the cost of STA, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>After casting this skill, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span> and in mid-air, hold <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</strong></span>, continuously consuming STA and dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span> to the target.<br>Depleting all STA or switching to another Resonator ends the skill action early.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</strong></span><br>When the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> button is released during <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</strong></span>, Hsin casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</strong></span>, consuming STA to perform a Plunging Attack, transforming into the Moon Fox upon landing and dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>After casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form: Reign at Ease</strong></span>, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Dodge Counter - Answering Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span>, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>After casting this skill, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> and not in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</strong></span> generates a <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Modular Heartlock</strong></span> at the target's position. Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</strong></span>, or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span> causes the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Modular Heartlock</strong></span> to collapse, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>Casting this skill consumes STA when Hsin is in mid-air.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, consume STA to command Xuanfang Mechanisms, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>After casting this skill, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> and on the ground, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Jump</strong></span> to cast this skill, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> and Hsin is in mid-air, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span> is replaced with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span>.<br>Consume STA to perform a Plunging Attack, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>After casting this skill, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 3</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> and in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state, command Xuanfang Mechanisms to perform up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> and in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>After casting this skill, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned Stage 3</strong></span>.</span> </div>  <h4 class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-300">Stat Bonus</h4> <div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2"><div data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="nested" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--nested  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconAttribute/T_Iconpropertyredbaoji_UI.webp" alt="Crit. Rate+" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Crit. Rate+</span> </div> </div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Crit. Rate increased by 1.20%.</span> </div>    </div><div data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="nested" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--nested  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconAttribute/T_Iconpropertyredbaoji_UI.webp" alt="Crit. Rate+" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Crit. Rate+</span> </div> </div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Crit. Rate increased by 2.80%.</span> </div>    </div></div> <div class="mt-4"><div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-300">Skill Attributes (Lv.10)</div> <dl class="ui-skill-metrics" data-ui="character-skill-metrics"