olor:#a89969"><strong>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span>, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill</strong></span> to deal <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.<br>After casting this skill, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> within a short time to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</strong></span>.<br>Can be cast in mid-air.<br><br>If Hsin moves while on the ground within a short time after casting this skill, she turns into the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span>. <br>- While in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span> form and out of combat, Hsin gains <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dustless Tread</strong></span>. With <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dustless Tread</strong></span>, Hsin can enter the target's aggro range without triggering combat. <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dustless Tread</strong></span> is removed when Hsin enters combat, is switched out, or ends the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span> form by having environmental, gameplay, or feature interactions.<br>- While in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span> form and out of combat, Hsin restores 6% of Max HP every 3s.<br>- Taking damage, failing to perform a <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dodge</strong></span> with directional input while on the ground, or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dodging</strong></span> in mid-air will end the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span> form. Switching to another Resonator or pressing <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill</strong></span> also ends the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span> form. Press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> to cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</strong></span>, which also ends the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span> form.<br>- The Dash state continuously consumes STA when Hsin is in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span> form.<br>- <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation</strong></span> is disabled when Hsin is in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Moon Fox</strong></span> form.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> and Hsin is on the ground, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill</strong></span> to have Hsin command a Colossal Xuanfang Mechanism, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>.</span> </div>  <h4 class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-300">Stat Bonus</h4> <div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2"><div data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="nested" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--nested  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconAttribute/T_Iconpropertyredattack_UI.webp" alt="ATK+" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">ATK+</span> </div> </div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">ATK increased by 1.80%.</span> </div>    </div><div data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="nested" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--nested  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__i