ing Form</strong></span>, when Hsin's <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131117" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131117">Answering Heart</a></strong></span> reaches 100 points, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form</strong></span> is replaced with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</strong></span>.<br>Hold <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> to cast the skill at the cost of STA and 100 points of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131117" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131117">Answering Heart</a></strong></span>. Hsin is immune to interruption during the action, and deals <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span> to the target, considered <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill DMG</strong></span>.<br>Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</strong></span> grants Hsin <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131114" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131114">Resolution of Wishes</a></strong></span>. This <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</strong></span> consumes <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131114" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131114">Resolution of Wishes</a></strong></span> to become <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</strong></span>, dealing greater DMG. <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131114" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131114">Resolution of Wishes</a></strong></span> can only be gained once every 24s.<br>While casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</strong></span>, if Hsin is not in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131120" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131120">Heart Manifest</a></strong></span> state, unlock <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, when Hsin's <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131118" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131118">Illumining Heart</a></strong></span> reaches 0 during the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span> is replaced with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</strong></span>.<br>Hold <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack</strong></span> to cast the skill at the cost of STA, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span> to the target, considered <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill DMG</strong></span>.<br>Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</strong></span> grants Hsin <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131115" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131115">Law of Heaven</a></strong></span>. This <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</strong></span> consumes <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131115" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131115">Law of Heaven</a></strong></span> to become <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</strong></span>, dealing greater DMG. <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131115" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131115">Law of Heaven</a></strong></span> can only be gained once every 24s.<br>Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</strong></span> ends the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state and unlocks <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span>.<br>Can be cast in mid-air.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, when Hsin's <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131118" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131118">Illumining Heart</a></strong></span> reaches 300 points and She is on the ground, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill</strong></span> is replaced with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span>.<br>When Hsin is on the ground, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill</strong></span> to deal <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span> to surrounding targets.<br>Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span> sends Hsin into the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Mechanism Dominion</strong></span><br>The <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Mechanism Dominion</strong></span> state lasts 13s.<br>While this state is active, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span> is replaced with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span>, and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</strong></span> is replaced with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span>.<br>When <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span> hits a target, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131118" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131118">Illumining Heart</a></strong></span> is consumed if Hsin is the active Resonator.<br>Exiting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Mechanism Dominion</strong></span> clears <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131118" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131118">Illumining Heart</a></strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span>, Hsin gains the following effects:<br>- Hsin can trigger <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131112" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131112">Unison Response</a></strong></span>, but not in Co-op Mode.<br>- After casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span>, the next <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</strong></span> grants Hsin <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131110" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131110">Unison</a></strong></span> for 5s.<br>- When Hsin triggers <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131112" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131112">Unison Response</a></strong></span>, She gains <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Source Intent</strong></span>, and this cast of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill</strong></span> is replaced with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</strong></span>, dealing greater DMG.<br>When Hsin casts an <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill</strong></span> without triggering <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131112" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131112">Unison Response</a></strong></span> while holding <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Source Intent</strong></span>, She consumes <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Source Intent</strong></span> instead, and the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill</strong></span> is replaced with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</strong></span>, dealing greater DMG.<br>- The aforementioned effects are removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.<br>- Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> sends Hsin directly into the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span>, Hsin gains the following effects:<br>- When Hsin enters combat, targets within a certain range do not lose <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> stacks when it's triggered.<br>- After Resonators in the team inflict <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink150806" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="150806">Electro Rage</a></strong></span> on a target, every 1 stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink150806" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="150806">Electro Rage</a></strong></span> inflicted grants Hsin 1 stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart of Thunder</strong></span>, stacking up to 100 times, and consumes all <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink150806" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="150806">Electro Rage</a></strong></span> stacks from that target. <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart of Thunder</strong></span> is removed when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.<br>- At the last stage of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</strong></span>, Hsin actively triggers 1 instance of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> DMG on the targets. Its DMG Multiplier is equal to 35% x (the number of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart of Thunder</strong></span> stacks on Hsin) x (the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the target's current <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> stacks).<br>While casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</strong></span>, switching to another Resonator or ending the skill early removes the above effects.<br>Some time after casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</strong></span>, Hsin consumes all remaining stacks of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart of Thunder</strong></span>.<br>When Hsin has at least 50 stacks of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart of Thunder</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span> stagnates nearby targets during the action.<br>- After casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</strong></span>, inflict <saptag=e>5 {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=E} of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on nearby targets within a certain range. It also makes <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span> inflict <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on hit targets, up to <saptag=a>5 {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=A}. Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</strong></span> again resets this count. Switching Resonance Mode removes it.<br><span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</strong></span> and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</strong></span> inflict <saptag=e>5 {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=E} of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on the target hit. <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form</strong></span>, and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</strong></span> inflict <saptag=f>1 {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=F} of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on the target hit.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Unison</strong></span><br>While Hsin is in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span> with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Unison</strong></span>, switching to another Resonator will remove Hsin's <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Unison</strong></span> to trigger Hsin's Outro Skill and the incoming Resonator's Intro Skill. If Hsin has full Concerto Energy and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Unison</strong></span> at the same time, only <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Unison</strong></span> is consumed to trigger the effect.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Unison Response</strong></span><br>While Hsin is in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span> and the active Resonator in the team has <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131110" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131110">Unison</a></strong></span>, Hsin triggers <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Unison Response</strong></span> after She is switched in and casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill</strong></span>, granting <saptag=g>1 {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=G} of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131111" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131111">Unison Boon</a></strong></span> to all Resonators in the team for 30s.<br>Hsin can only grant up to <saptag=g>1 {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=G} of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131111" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131111">Unison Boon</a></strong></span> in this way.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Unison Boon</strong></span><br>Only the Resonators who can trigger Unison Response can gain this effect. Each stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Unison Boon</strong></span> increases the total DMG dealt by Resonators who can trigger <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131112" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131112">Unison Response</a></strong></span> in the team by 3%, stacking up to 2 times.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Answering Heart</strong></span><br>Can hold up to 100 points of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Heart</strong></span>.<br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span>, when <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack - Answering Form</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form</strong></span>, or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> hits a target, Hsin gains <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Heart</strong></span> if She is the active Resonator.<br>Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> grants 60 points of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Heart</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Illumining Heart</strong></span><br>Can hold up to 300 points of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Heart</strong></span>.<br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> and not in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state, when <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Normal Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span>, or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span> hits a target, Hsin gains <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Heart</strong></span> if She is the active Resonator.<br>- While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span>, casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> directly sends Hsin into the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state and grants 300 points of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Heart</strong></span>.<br>- While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span>, after casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</strong></span>, when the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Modular Heartlock</strong></span> generated by <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 1</strong></span> is collapsed by <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Illumining Form Stage 2</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</strong></span>, or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</strong></span>, additionally gain 150 points of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Heart</strong></span> if Hsin is the active Resonator in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> but not in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131116" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131116">Mechanism Dominion</a></strong></span> state. This effect can only be triggered once before the next cast of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</strong></span> resets it, and is disabled when switched to the other Resonance Mode.</saptag=g></saptag=g></saptag=f></saptag=e></saptag=a></saptag=e></span> </div> <h4 class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-300">Inherent Skills</h4> <div class="mt-2 grid gap-2"><div data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="nested" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--nested  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Atlas/SkillIcon/SkillIconXin/SP_IconXinD1.webp" alt="Tides of Succession" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Tides of Succession</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Inherent Skill</span> </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span>, when Hsin casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span>, Her ATK is increased by 50% for 8s. Switching to another Resonator or Resonance Mode ends this effect.<br><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span>, after Resonators in the team inflict <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span>, Hsin gains 25% Electro DMG Bonus, stacking up to 2 times. Each Resonator can trigger this effect only once. In addition, if Rover: Electro is in the same team, when Rover: Electro casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Thunderous Fury</strong></span>, both Hsin and Rover: Electro gain 20% Electro DMG Bonus for 30s.<br>This effect resets when a Resonator is added to the team or when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.</span> </div>    </div><div data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="nested" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--nested  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Atlas/SkillIcon/SkillIconXin/SP_IconXinD2.webp" alt="Gleaning Simple Joys" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Gleaning Simple Joys</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Inherent Skill</span> </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span>, the maximum stacks of the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131111" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131111">Unison Boon</a></strong></span> effect on Resonators in the team are increased by 1. When a Resonator in the team triggers <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131112" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131112">Unison Response</a></strong></span>, all Resonators in the team gain 1 stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131111" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131111">Unison Boon</a></strong></span> for 30s. This effect does not stack.<br><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span> and Hsin is not in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131120" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131120">Heart Manifest</a></strong></span> state, after Resonators in the team other than Hsin inflict <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on a target, every 1 stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> inflicted grants Hisn 1 stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Thunderglow</strong></span>, stacking up to 10 times.<br>While Hsin is in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131120" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131120">Heart Manifest</a></strong></span> state, when targets within a certain range have 0 stacks of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span>, inflict 1 stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on the targets. If <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Thunderglow</strong></span> on Hsin reaches the stack limit, Hsin also inflicts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Fleeting Thunder</strong></span> on the targets:<br>- When Hsin inflicts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Fleeting Thunder</strong></span> on the target, She also inflicts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on the target to the stack limit, up to 16 stacks of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span>.<br>- When <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Fleeting Thunder</strong></span> is active, if the maximum stacks of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on the target is increased, Hsin will inflict <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> on the target to the stack limit again, up to 16 stacks of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span>.<br>- <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Fleeting Thunder</strong></span> will be removed when the target leaves the designated range around Hsin.<br>Exiting the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131120" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131120">Heart Manifest</a></strong></span> state or switching Resonance Mode removes the aforementioned effects.</