<strong>Formshift</strong></span>.<br>Cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Formshift</strong></span> to unfurl the Manifold Sanctum. Hsin switches to <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities, and enters the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131120" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131120">Heart Manifest</a></strong></span> state.<br>Can be cast in mid-air close to the ground.<br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, engaging in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>quest dialogue</strong></span>, performing an <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>environmental interaction with an animation</strong></span>, or using a <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Utility</strong></span> switches Hsin back to <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span> to perform the corresponding action.<br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, Hsin can walk on the surface of water, and will continuously consume STA in deep water areas. In Walking Mode, Hsin in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> can step off a cliff into the air and walk slowly in mid-air, continuously consuming STA in this state. Hsin cannot restore STA while in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> and in mid-air.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span><br>After casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</strong></span>, when in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> with full Resonance Energy, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span> becomes available.<br>Cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span> to bring the Manifold Sanctum crashing down, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span> to the target, considered <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill DMG</strong></span>.<br>Can be cast in mid-air close to the ground.<br>Hsin returns to <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span> and exits the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131120" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131120">Heart Manifest</a></strong></span> state.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Edict</strong></span><br>Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Formshift</strong></span> grants Hsin 21 stacks of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Edict</strong></span> for 45s. The effect cannot exceed 21 stacks and all stacks are removed when the duration ends.<br>After a Resonator on the field deals DMG, Hsin automatically consumes <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Edict</strong></span> in the following 3s to trigger the following effect up to once per second. Retriggering the effect resets the duration:<br>- When <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Edict</strong></span> is consumed, summon a <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Soaring Pillar</strong></span> from the Manifold Sanctum as a Coordinated Attack to strike the target once, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span>. <br>- <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Edict</strong></span> can be automatically consumed up to 1 stack per second.<br>- Damage dealt by <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Soaring Pillar</strong></span> does not trigger this effect.<br>- When Hsin is knocked out, all <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Edict</strong></span> stacks are removed.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Heart Manifest</strong></span><br>Increases Hsin's resistance to interruption for 45s.<br>Entering the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart Manifest</strong></span> state resets Hsin's <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>.<br>While in the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart Manifest</strong></span> state and in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, if <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span> is locked, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation</strong></span> to have Hsin cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Invoked Form: Answering</strong></span>. While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span>, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation</strong></span> to have Hsin cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Invoked Form: Illumining</strong></span>.<br>Besides, if Hsin is still in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span> after exiting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart Manifest</strong></span>, and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span> is locked, press <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation</strong></span> to have Hsin cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Invoked Form: Answering</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Invoked Form: Answering</strong></span><br>Hsin temporarily reverts to <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</strong></span>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</strong></span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a89969"><strong>Invoked Form: Illumining</strong></span><br>Hsin turns back into <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</strong></span>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</strong></span>.</span> </div>  <h4 class="mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-300">Stat Bonus</h4> <div class="mt-2 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2"><div data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="nested" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--nested  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconAttribute/T_Iconpropertyredattack_UI.webp" alt="ATK+" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">ATK+</span> </div> </div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">ATK increased by 1.80%.</span> </div>    </div><div data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="nested" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--nested  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconAttribute/T_Iconpropertyredattack_UI.webp" alt="ATK+" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">ATK+</span> </div> </div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">ATK increased by 4.20%.</span> </div>    </div></div> <div class="mt-4"><div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-300">Skill Attributes (Lv.10)</div> <dl class="ui-skil