="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Atlas/SkillIcon/SkillIconXin/SP_IconXinT.webp" alt="Herself a Thousand Lanterns" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Herself a Thousand Lanterns</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Outro Skill</span> </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Attack the target, dealing <span style="color:#b45bff"><strong>Electro DMG</strong></span> equal to 100% of Hsin's ATK.<br>Hsin gains <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Nightglow</strong></span> upon entering combat or casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span>. When Hsin casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Outro Skill</strong></span>, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Nightglow</strong></span> is consumed to trigger various effects depending on the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode</strong></span> She is in:<br>- While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span>, Resonators in the team other than Hsin gain <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Shared Light</strong></span> when they gain <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131110" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131110">Unison</a></strong></span>. After Hsin casts <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Outro Skill</strong></span>, Resonators with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Shared Light</strong></span> gain 20% All DMG Amplification for 30s.<br>- While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span>, Resonators in the team other than Hsin gain 20% Electro DMG Amplification for 20s.<br>The above effects end early when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.</span> </div>        </article><article data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="default" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--default  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Atlas/SkillIcon/SkillIconNor/SP_IconWeakPointBreakMagic.webp" alt="Tune Break: Rectifier" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Tune Break: Rectifier</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Tune Break</span> </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">When the target's <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Off-Tune Level</strong></span> is full, the Resonator may cast <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink100001" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="100001">Tune Break</a></strong></span> on the target.</span> </div>        </article></div></section> <section data-ui="surface" data-variant="surface" class="ui-section ui-section--surface ui-section--normal ui-section--separated"><h2 class="ui-section-title font-display text-lg font-bold">Resonance Chain</h2> <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-2"><article data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="feature" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--feature  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconDevice/T_IconDevice_XinM1_UI.webp" alt="A Boat to Cross the Rising Tide" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">A Boat to Cross the Rising Tide</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta">Resonance Chain 1 </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Casting <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Formshift</strong></span> grants Hsin 2 stacks of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Radiance Ward</strong></span>, stacking up to 2 times. Switching to <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Answering Form</strong></span> clears all stacks. When Hsin takes DMG from an enemy target's attack, 1 stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Radiance Ward</strong></span> can be consumed to make Her immune to interruption and reduce DMG taken by 60% for 1s. This effect can be triggered once every 1s.<br><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span>:<br>The DMG Multipliers of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> are increased by 15%, and each stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131111" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131111">Unison Boon</a></strong></span> additionally increases the DMG Multipliers of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</strong></span> by 10%, up to a total of 4 stacks.<br><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span>:<br>When Hsin enters combat, if <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131113" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131113">Heart of Thunder</a></strong></span> is below 50 stacks, it is increased to 50 stacks, triggered once every 12s.<br>The DMG Multiplier of the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> DMG triggered by <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Skill - Heartward by Moon</strong></span> is increased to 42% x (the number of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heart of Thunder</strong></span> stacks on Hsin) x (the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the target's current <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> stacks).</span> </div>    </article><article data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="feature" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--feature  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconDevice/T_IconDevice_XinM2_UI.webp" alt="To Wake Is to Wonder What I Am" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">To Wake Is to Wonder What I Am</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta">Resonance Chain 2 </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">The DMG Multipliers of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</strong></span> and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</strong></span> are increased by 60%.<br>The DMG Multipliers of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</strong></span> and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</strong></span> are increased by 60%.<br><br>When Hsin enters combat, reset the Cooldowns for Hsin to gain <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131114" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131114">Resolution of Wishes</a></strong></span> and <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131115" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131115">Law of Heaven</a></strong></span>, and restore 100 additional points of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131117" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131117">Answering Heart</a></strong></span>. This effect can be triggered once every 12s.</span> </div>    </article><article data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="feature" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--feature  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconDevice/T_IconDevice_XinM3_UI.webp" alt="A Dream of Return Among the Hills" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">A Dream of Return Among the Hills</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta">Resonance Chain 3 </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">The DMG Multiplier of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span> is increased by 70%.<br><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span>:<br>The Crit. DMG of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span> is increased by 20%, and each stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131111" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131111">Unison Boon</a></strong></span> additionally increases its Crit. DMG by 15%, up to a total of 4 stacks.<br><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span>:<br>When the last stage of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</strong></span> hits a target inflicted with <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span>, it triggers 1 instance of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> DMG, with its DMG Multiplier equal to 1500% times the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> DMG Multiplier corresponding to the current <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> stacks on the target.</span> </div>    </article><article data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="feature" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--feature  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconDevice/T_IconDevice_XinM4_UI.webp" alt="A River of Lanterns, a River of Wishes" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">A River of Lanterns, a River of Wishes</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta">Resonance Chain 4 </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">All Resonators in the team gain 20% All-Attribute DMG Bonus for 30s when a Resonator in the team triggers any of the following actions:<br>- Inflict <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> or <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink150806" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="150806">Electro Rage</a></strong></span> on a target.<br>- Gain <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131110" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131110">Unison</a></strong></span> while not having the effect.<br>- Trigger <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131112" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131112">Unison Response</a></strong></span>.</span> </div>    </article><article data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="feature" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--feature  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconDevice/T_IconDevice_XinM5_UI.webp" alt="Forms Turn as the Heart Wills" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Forms Turn as the Heart Wills</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta">Resonance Chain 5 </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Illumining Form</strong></span>, DMG taken by Hsin is reduced by 20%.<br>When Hsin takes a fatal blow, She will not be knocked out, but instead restores 100% of Max HP and becomes immune to DMG and interruption for 1s. This effect can be triggered once every 10 minutes.</span> </div>    </article><article data-ui="character-skill-card" data-variant="feature" data-status="unchanged" class="ui-skill-card ui-skill-card--feature  ui-skill-card--unchanged"><header class="ui-skill-card__header" data-ui="character-skill-header"><div class="ui-skill-card__icon"><img src="https://static.nanoka.cc/assets/ww/UIResources/Common/Image/IconDevice/T_IconDevice_XinM6_UI.webp" alt="The Moon Owes Its Light to the Living" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__heading"><div class="ui-skill-card__title"><span style="white-space:pre-line">The Moon Owes Its Light to the Living</span> </div> <div class="ui-skill-card__meta">Resonance Chain 6 </div></div> </header> <div class="ui-skill-description" data-ui="character-skill-description"><span style="white-space:pre-line">Targets take 40% more Resonance Skill DMG from Hsin.<br><br>Resonance Skill DMG dealt by Hsin ignores 20% of the target's DEF.<br><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Unison</strong></span>:<br>The maximum stacks of the <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131111" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131111">Unison Boon</a></strong></span> effect on Resonators in the team are additionally increased by 1. When a Resonator in the team triggers <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131112" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131112">Unison Response</a></strong></span>, all Resonators in the team additionally gain 1 stack of <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink131111" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="131111">Unison Boon</a></strong></span> for 30s. This effect does not stack.<br><br>While in <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</strong></span>:<br>While in combat, <span style="color:#f7ca2f"><strong><a href="https://ww.nanoka.cc/character/1311#WwLink850013" class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:cursor-help hover:text-accent" data-ww-link-id="850013">Electro Flare</a></strong></span> DMG taken by targets within a certain range around Hsin can be Critical, with Crit. Rate fixed at 80% and Crit. DMG fixed at 230%.</span> </div>    </article></div></section> <s